{
  "author": "KC桌面",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根士丹利：中国消费级AI路径-超越聊天机器人竞赛</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">MS这份《Consumer AI:Beyond the Chatbot Race》给出的核心判断并不复杂：中国消费级AI的领先，靠的不是前沿模型，而是分发渠道和使用场景的匹配。报告用一组对比数字开场——AlphaWise调查显示中国每周使用个人AI的比例达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">80%</span>，美国为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">54%</span>。这个差距出现在两个市场基础访问都免费的前提下，说明差异不在价格，而在AI被放进了哪里。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWL4TCRXkCicibd3PqI9RGtBCDGITUYibyFD158xXC6kXLesbWYuqiazwAzXaicJnrxmJDKfCy39qD2Xn4sXK3hSxqcePDnKXqf6NIg/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_01.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOW3kgl5YAC3vTXFy62v4064XupvqicicIQia0pics3dXBLfk4pNSjQWsfnmQ7yZibRkmw2seVXRT8L4sVbCicWtYUYulBU2QsQicibO0e8/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_02.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXDHgiaYpE7Z9E1aqgMibjnKGHIbC5oUhUpkTYXPrZmDgLNCfhL18v7xOQB7Fl13icntSQYFo3LXkzY5hJUPXibEJ6vCucQKlIIpnA/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_03.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<section style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#737D8C;font-size:12px;line-height:1.75\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">——人工智能免责声明（部分内容由人工智能工具辅助生成）</p><p style=\"margin:0\">撰稿：Mia<br>责编：KC<br>排版：胡桃</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWxE0pHoyB91zgCg4pd070CCiboiacgH04wFibEcjXt0yEBOsLZ8nd4L5icibe2mzZQnxow3qBocayLvpJ9ic9qEKADic7V0tcHgaXjT0/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC桌面\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 49-MS-China-s Al Path Consumer Al-Beyond the Chatbot Race-260914</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
